  "instructions": [
    "Bring the fish stock to a boil in the ceramic tagine over high heat.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and minced garlic to the tagine and boil for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the lemongrass stalks to the tagine and boil for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the ikura to the tagine, simmering for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the soy sauce and sesame oil.",
    "Serve the ikura and broth over cooked jasmine rice.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
